{"title": "Dreadful Hewer", "pageid": 28307, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dreadful_Hewer", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dreadful Hewer</b> is a passive feature that makes it difficult for enemies to resist your fearful abilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your foes have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> to resist your spells or actions that inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Fear</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_the_Undevout\" title=\"Shield of the Undevout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Shield_of_the_Undevout_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_the_Undevout\" title=\"Shield of the Undevout\">Shield of the Undevout</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite misleading tooltips, Dreadful Hewer provides <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on target's Saving Throws for many effects applying <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fearful\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Fearful_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fearful_(Condition)\" title=\"Fearful (Condition)\">Fearful</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> conditions.\n<ul><li>The passive affects <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrathful Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\">Wrathful Smite</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fear\" title=\"Fear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Fear_Icon.webp/20px-Fear_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Fear_Icon.webp/30px-Fear_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Fear_Icon.webp/40px-Fear_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Fear_Icon.webp/20px-Fear_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Fear_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fear\" title=\"Fear\">Fear</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Menacing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Menacing Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Menacing Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Menacing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Menacing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Menacing Attack (Melee)\">Menacing Attack (Melee)</a> (and its variants), <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dissonant_Whispers\" title=\"Dissonant Whispers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp/20px-Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp/30px-Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp/40px-Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dissonant Whispers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp/20px-Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Dissonant_Whispers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dissonant_Whispers\" title=\"Dissonant Whispers\">Dissonant Whispers</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dreadful_Aspect\" title=\"Dreadful Aspect\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp/20px-Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp/30px-Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp/40px-Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dreadful Aspect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp/20px-Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Dreadful_Aspect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dreadful_Aspect\" title=\"Dreadful Aspect\">Dreadful Aspect</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Presence:_Disturbing\" title=\"Fey Presence: Disturbing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/30px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/40px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fey Presence: Disturbing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Presence:_Disturbing\" title=\"Fey Presence: Disturbing\">Fey Presence: Disturbing</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Fear\" title=\"Ray of Fear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ray of Fear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Fear\" title=\"Ray of Fear\">Ray of Fear</a>.</li>\n<li>The passive does not affect <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mortal_Reminder\" title=\"Mortal Reminder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp/20px-Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp/30px-Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp/40px-Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mortal Reminder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp/20px-Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Mortal_Reminder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mortal_Reminder\" title=\"Mortal Reminder\">Mortal Reminder</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intimidating_Presence\" title=\"Intimidating Presence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp/30px-Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp/40px-Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intimidating Presence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Intimidating_Presence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidating_Presence\" title=\"Intimidating Presence\">Intimidating Presence</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Panicked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\">Eyebite: Panicked</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood-Curdling_Emission\" title=\"Blood-Curdling Emission\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/